# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and restart `pnpm dev` after changes.

# =============================================================================
# API origin (`NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE`)
# =============================================================================
# Site **origin only** — no path, no trailing slash. OpenAPI UI is separate
# (e.g. https://tamm.ultimate-dev2.com/api/documentation ) — do not put `/api/documentation` here.
# The app calls `{base}/api/v1/...` per docs/api-contracts.md.
#
# When **set** (`pnpm dev` or production): browser talks to this host (configure Laravel CORS for localhost in dev).
# When **empty** during `pnpm dev` only: calls stay on Nuxt — proxied to `NUXT_DEV_PROXY_TARGET`.
#
# Staging / integration (uncomment — Laravel must allow your localhost origin in CORS):
# NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://tamm.ultimate-dev2.com

# =============================================================================
# Local Laravel only (when `NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` is commented out or removed)
# =============================================================================
# NUXT_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# =============================================================================
# Backend checklist (Laravel team / infra)
# =============================================================================
# - CORS: allow http://localhost:3000 and http://localhost:3001 (and your deployed SPA URL).
# - HTTPS in production; cookies may need Secure / SameSite if cross-site.
# - POST https://tamm.ultimate-dev2.com/api/v1/auth/login — verify JSON contract.

# =============================================================================
# Admin dashboard (`useAdminDashboard`)
# =============================================================================
# Default: mock data (GET /admin/dashboard is not contract-complete). Set to `true` to call the live API.
# VITE_ADMIN_DASHBOARD_USE_LIVE_API=true
